1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,902
Minimum payment due: $150.

2
00:00:03,322 --> 00:00:04,208
Here's the catch.

3
00:00:04,628 --> 00:00:10,697
The minimum shrinks as you pay. $150. Then $134. Then $83. Then $45.

4
00:00:11,117 --> 00:00:17,513
Paying only the minimum on $5,000: 201 months, and $8,442 in interest.

5
00:00:17,933 --> 00:00:22,088
The fix: freeze your payment at today's minimum. Fifty-six months instead.

6
00:00:22,858 --> 00:00:24,468
The full math is on my channel.
